  <h2>1. Fabric & Color Development</h2>
  <p>We offer <strong>Custom Fabric</strong> sourcing and <strong>Custom Color</strong> matching using Pantone references. Whether you need a specific moisture-wicking blend or a unique "Nulu-feel" texture, our team can develop fabrics from the fiber level.</p>

