  <h2>2. Branding & Hardware</h2>
  <p>Our <strong>Logo Printing</strong> capabilities include Silicone, PU, Embroidery, and Reflective Silver options. We also provide full service for <strong>Custom Care Labels</strong>, <strong>Hang Tags</strong>, and even branded <strong>Packaging bags</strong> to ensure a premium unboxing experience for your customers.</p>
  
  <p>From woven labels to zipper PE bags, we handle every detail so you can focus on growing your community.</p>
